# AI-Powered YouTube Video Creation using Prompt Chains

This project demonstrates how prompt chaining and AI tools can be used to create a complete YouTube video from scratch — including ideation, scripting, thumbnail concepts, and video production.

## 🎯 Objective
To use prompt chains with AI tools to generate:
- Engaging YouTube titles
- A full video script
- Thumbnail ideas
- A final AI-edited video

## 🛠 Tools Used
- ChatGPT – prompt chaining, script & ideas
- Canva / DALL·E – thumbnail generation
- Pictory / InVideo – video creation
- Notion – documentation
- GitHub – project hosting

